| `[本地实体]` | 自己角色指针 | UE: `UWorld+[OwningGameInstance]` → `LocalPlayers[0]` → `Pawn` |
| `[实体列表]` | 敌人数组 | UE: `ULevel+[ActorArray]`；Unity: `GObjects` 遍历或 `EntityManager` |
| `[骨骼/头坐标]` | 头部世界坐标 | UE: `Actor+[Mesh]` → `BoneArray`；Unity: `Transform` 链或 `Bone` 字段 |

